UnitVelodromeMigrationEntrypoint::Handle
├── when the caller is not the Hyperlane mailbox
│   └── it should revert with CallerNotMailbox
├── when the origin is not the OP domain
│   └── it should revert with UnauthorizedOrigin
├── when the sender is not the entrypoint contract
│   └── it should revert with UnauthorizedSender
├── when the message length is invalid
│   └── it should revert with InvalidMessageLength
└── when the message is valid
    ├── when the nonce has already been used
    │   └── it should revert with NonceAlreadyUsed
    └── when the nonce has not been used
        ├── when the token amount exceeds the remaining budget
        │   ├── it should revert with BudgetExhausted
        │   └── it should process the same settlement after the entrypoint is topped up
        └── when the token amount does not exceed the remaining budget
            ├── when the migration is liquid
            │   ├── when the token amount exhausts the remaining budget
            │   │   ├── it should mark the nonce as used
            │   │   ├── it should increase paid by the token amount
            │   │   ├── it should transfer the token amount to the recipient
            │   │   └── it should emit the Migrated event
            │   └── when the token amount leaves remaining budget
            │       ├── it should mark the nonce as used
            │       ├── it should increase paid by the token amount
            │       ├── it should transfer the token amount to the recipient
            │       └── it should emit the Migrated event
            └── when the migration is staked
                ├── when the stake is permanent
                │   ├── it should mark the nonce as used
                │   ├── it should increase paid by the token amount
                │   ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the token amount
                │   ├── it should create a permanent v3 staked position with zero duration
                │   ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                │   └── it should emit the Migrated event
                └── when the stake is not permanent
                    ├── when the duration exceeds the maximum accepted after delivery
                    │   ├── when settlement occurs during the first three days of the epoch
                    │   │   ├── it should mark the nonce as used
                    │   │   ├── it should increase paid by the token amount
                    │   │   ├── it should clamp the duration to the maximum accepted after delivery
                    │   │   ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the token amount
                    │   │   ├── it should create a decaying v3 staked position
                    │   │   ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                    │   │   └── it should emit the Migrated event
                    │   └── when settlement occurs during the final four days of the epoch
                    │       ├── it should mark the nonce as used
                    │       ├── it should increase paid by the token amount
                    │       ├── it should clamp the duration to the maximum accepted after delivery
                    │       ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the token amount
                    │       ├── it should create a decaying v3 staked position
                    │       ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                    │       └── it should emit the Migrated event
                    └── when the duration does not exceed the maximum accepted after delivery
                        ├── when the maximum accepted duration is requested
                        │   ├── it should mark the nonce as used
                        │   ├── it should increase paid by the token amount
                        │   ├── it should leave the duration unchanged
                        │   ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the token amount
                        │   ├── it should create a decaying v3 staked position
                        │   ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                        │   └── it should emit the Migrated event
                        └── when the duration is below the maximum accepted after delivery
                            ├── it should mark the nonce as used
                            ├── it should increase paid by the token amount
                            ├── it should leave the duration unchanged
                            ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the token amount
                            ├── it should create a decaying v3 staked position
                            ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                            └── it should emit the Migrated event
